    <h1>Same plug. What’s inside?</h1>
    <p>Open a cable. Explore its parts. See what changes when you switch.</p>
  </header>
  <noscript><p>The interactive model needs JavaScript. You can still read the component guide and connection table below.</p><style>.guided-explore,.cable-picker,.model-stage,.model-controls,.part-panel,.selection-status{display:none}</style></noscript>
  <section class="guided-explore" aria-label="Guided questions">
